    "body": "> And we hope that folks don't adopt this pattern you just established where you write object in IDL and\n> handle it in prose?\n\n@annevk You can always do that, obviously.  You can write all your IDL with `any` for all types and do everything in prose.  The idea is that people should probably stop and notice when they're doing that...  I really don't know how to ensure that, though.\n",
